      {
        "npc": "Hello human."
      },
      {
        "player": "Hello. What do you do here?"
      },
      {
        "npc": "I'm Dusuri. I specialise in unique minerals that can't be found on Gielinor."
      },
      {
        "player": "Can't be found on Gielinor? Where do they come from then?"
      },
      {
        "npc": "To be honest, we don't fully know. All we know is that they can be found within shooting stars."
